# libexpat1 in Debian bookworm: the tracker names 2.5.0-1+deb12u4 as the fix,
# but bookworm-security still serves deb12u3, so no build can install it.
# Each entry expires on its own; the image's `apt-get upgrade` installs the
# fix once Debian publishes it.
